    "detailed_description": "Test your Solitaire stacking skills as the cards fall faster and faster.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMatch cards to clear stacks and don't let them reach the top!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWin tickets for playing just like in the real arcade and spend them on prizes like animated characters and backgrounds you can pin to your game home screen.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay the daily challenges for bonus tickets and if you're competitive, join the weekly league and compete to put your name in lights on the coveted home screen marquee.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay head-to-head by simply starting your game at the same time as another player. It's magic!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhether it's a high-scoring Classic game or a short but intense Quick game, there's always a game to suit your skill level and mood!",
